---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="About TLR">
  <article class="post wrap">
    <p><a href={`${base}/tlr`}>← The Learning Rate</a></p>
    <h1>Why TLR?</h1>
    <p>
      Most of what we learned in school never made it into a job description. The proofs, the models, the late nights
      chasing a bug that turned out to be a sign error — that stuff doesn't show up in a sprint board.
    </p>
    <p>
      TLR started because we didn't want it to just... disappear. It's a place to keep explaining things the way we
      wish someone had explained them to us — and, slowly, to make room for whoever else wants to do the same.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
